{"id":"n84966-1-7","stage":4,"title":"행 · 行","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84966-1-7-1","ko":"선생님, 이 시를 끝까지 읽을까요?","zh":"老师，要读完这首诗吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"선생님,","meaning":"先生","explanation":"선생님：先生","readings":[{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62818","senseId":"2","lemma":"선생님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시를","meaning":"诗","explanation":"시：诗；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15954","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝까지","meaning":"完，到头，最后","explanation":"끝：完，到头，最后；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"끝","audio":"/audio/fa22cdfb3221d82b98bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48072","senseId":"4","lemma":"끝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"읽을까요?","meaning":"读，朗读","explanation":"읽다：读，朗读；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"읽다","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68752","senseId":"1","lemma":"읽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"daac5ca7b302bd9b","term":"선생님","zh":"先生","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3","entryId":"62818","definition":"加在某人的姓氏或职业之后，以表示对其的尊敬。","pronunciation":["선생님"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"bfa42cf6a12e9123","term":"시","zh":"诗","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3","entryId":"15954","definition":"通过有韵律的形式来表达作者的想法和感受的文学作品。","pronunciation":["시"]},{"id":"fa22cdfb3221d82b","term":"끝","zh":"完，到头，最后","audio":"/audio/fa22cdfb3221d82b98bd.mp3","entryId":"48072","definition":"事情或顺序的最终。","pronunciation":["끋"]},{"id":"f843025cff483034","term":"읽다","zh":"读，朗读","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3","entryId":"68752","definition":"把文字或文章出声念出来。","pronunciation":["익따"]}],"audio":"/audio/25373f88f4f1de1e5740.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84966-1-7-2","ko":"아니요. 다음 행까지만 읽으세요.","zh":"不用了，只读到下一行就可以了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다음","meaning":"下面，下一个","explanation":"다음：下面，下一个","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"8","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"행까지만","meaning":"行，列，字行","explanation":"행：行，列，字行；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"행","audio":"/audio/fc48bc81cceacc6d7c33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84966","senseId":"1","lemma":"행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"읽으세요.","meaning":"读，朗读","explanation":"읽다：读，朗读；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"읽다","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68752","senseId":"1","lemma":"읽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","term":"아니요","zh":"不是，不用","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3","entryId":"17189","definition":"用于否定回答长辈所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니요"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"下面，下一个","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"话或文字之后连接的内容。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"fc48bc81cceacc6d","term":"행","zh":"行，列，字行","audio":"/audio/fc48bc81cceacc6d7c33.mp3","entryId":"84966","definition":"横竖排列的字。","pronunciation":["행"]},{"id":"f843025cff483034","term":"읽다","zh":"读，朗读","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3","entryId":